---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { profile } from '../data/profile';
---
<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy">
  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>{profile.name} · E-mail: <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email}</a></p>

  <h2>In short</h2>
  <p>
    This is a personal website. It uses no cookies, no contact forms and no advertising or social-media tracking.
    Only the minimum data needed to deliver the site and to count visits anonymously is processed.
  </p>

  <h2>Hosting (GitHub Pages)</h2>
  <p>
    This website is hosted by GitHub Pages, a service of GitHub, Inc., 88 Colin P. Kelly Jr. Street, San Francisco,
    CA 94107, USA. When you visit the site, GitHub processes technical data such as your IP address, the requested page,
    date and time, and browser information in server logs in order to deliver the site and keep it secure.
    Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest in a secure and reliable website). GitHub is certified under the
    EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework. More information:
    <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub Privacy Statement</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Visitor statistics (Cloudflare Web Analytics)</h2>
  <p>
    To understand how many people visit this site and from which countries, I use Cloudflare Web Analytics, a service of
    Cloudflare, Inc., 101 Townsend St., San Francisco, CA 94107, USA. It does not set cookies, does not use
    local storage and does not create individual user profiles. It records aggregated data such as page views, referring
    website, country, device type and browser. Legal basis: Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest in anonymous reach
    statistics). Cloudflare is certified under the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework. More information:
    <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare Privacy Policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Fonts</h2>
  <p>All fonts are served from this website itself. No connection to Google Fonts or other font services is made.</p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>
    Links to LinkedIn, GitHub and other sites only transfer data to those providers once you click them.
    Their own privacy policies then apply.
  </p>

  <h2>E-mail contact</h2>
  <p>If you e-mail me, I use your details only to reply and do not share them.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under the GDPR you have the right to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>access the personal data stored about you (Art. 15),</li>
    <li>rectification or erasure (Art. 16, 17),</li>
    <li>restriction of processing (Art. 18) and data portability (Art. 20),</li>
    <li>object to processing based on legitimate interest (Art. 21),</li>
    <li>lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority (Art. 77).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>To exercise these rights, just send me an e-mail.</p>

  <p class="mt-10 text-xs">Last updated: November 2026</p>
</LegalPage>
